To access files inside an Azure container pod, follow the below steps to access files through SFTP

Copying files from local drive to Azure pod

kubectl cp <pod_name>:<directory>/<file_name> <target_file_name> -n <namespace>
sftp <username>@<host>:<destination_folder_in_sftp>
put <file_name_in_container>

Same method to copy files from Azure pod to local drive, but use get instead of put

 
